\frametitle{Recovery limits: standard-Bayes and project-pool corners are exact to machine precision}
257 of 259 acceptance criteria are verified. The pure-NumPy/SciPy core
carries project test coverage of 90.26\% (gate \(\ge 90\%\)), with every
stochastic step threaded through a single seeded
\breaktt{np.random.default\_rng(0)}. sec.~10
records the full environment fingerprint, and the expected-free-energy
identity that underwrites the active-inference substrate is proven and
visualized in sec.~6.2 (fig.~7).
